{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1341100800, "end_date": 1341705599, "month_true_total": 323, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:46:20 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "4090120", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031884787", "personaname": "Tenebro ⚜", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031884787/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 4067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2295, "last_played": 1453279511, "avatar": "a31ce72127509ed65fe2ffbe44a0d6f4d093095b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This Is WAR!!!", "timestamp_created": 1341676250, "timestamp_updated": 1341676250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1189333", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988827286", "personaname": "Lt. Labcoat", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LtLabcoat/", "num_games_owned": 2929, "num_reviews": 563, "playtime_forever": 1479, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1371, "last_played": 1476816851, "avatar": "f5e4e8b45c8e71eb0973ee563bfce2a287454db6"}, "language": "english", "review": "In the past, I would've called this a really fun third-person hack'n'shoot. But now... now there's just not enough people online to say it's a great game. Which is a real pity.\n\nOh well.", "timestamp_created": 1341666824, "timestamp_updated": 1385485554, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.447321951389312744", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2434723", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007292614", "personaname": "Erick_Bloodaxe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198007292614/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2016, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1644, "last_played": 1598115195, "avatar": "ec357dc709947bdc5d67d737dde0f019005df07b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like DoW and I like killing Orks.  It's got shooting of all sorts, explosives, and mele weapons... what's not to like?", "timestamp_created": 1341616486, "timestamp_updated": 1341616486, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1208556", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989254794", "personaname": "ComradeWinston", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/comradewinston/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 462, "playtime_forever": 2497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2025, "last_played": 1632890428, "avatar": "abbd37cb05df7f98cabaab060ffc09e0a02210c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "The campaign is a bit predictable though still enjoyable. Multiplayer has a number of options most other shooters have, team deathmatch, capture the flag, capture the point, ect. Generally its a pretty damn good game, especially for a third person shooter.\n\nThough what makes this game so enjoyable is the feeling of being a space marine. Walking around in the massive suit of armor, beating the minions of chaos back into the warp with your warhammer, obliterating the enemies of the emperor with a plasma cannon. There's nothing like it and you'll certainly enjoy this game if you're a fan of Warhammer 40k. You don't even have to be a fan to love it—in fact, you're conscripted. Get your heretical ass into this game already.", "timestamp_created": 1341596939, "timestamp_updated": 1407145486, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4088355", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031857509", "personaname": "Adolf Jalfrezi Tudor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/adamshifnal/", "num_games_owned": 390, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 4156, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3696, "last_played": 1539472141, "avatar": "313e399f7f072ab297fe0036612987b0091b0454"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine has a really good campaign, lots of gore and epic action to boot! However the PvP multiplayer is pretty piss poor since there is no match making system, it just picks players and shoves them in a game. Not a brilliant start for those who are new to the game. Furthermore the PvP multi is Peer2Peer....making it extremely laggy since most players are from other countrys. Although the \"Exterminatus\" mode (waves of hordes) is a really good addition to the game and well worth giving that ago.\n\nIf Relic or THQ could be bothered to patch this game, it may be one of the best Shooting games that I own. Until then, I will not be playing the PvP multi due to the inbalance and lag.", "timestamp_created": 1341525158, "timestamp_updated": 1341525158, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}